  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline CASH is Julian Cash's signature round co-polyester string, developed specifically for modern elite doubles. Built from the A5 platform, CASH uses a softer flex profile to increase dwell time, pocketing and touch while maintaining elite snapback, low friction and outstanding tension stability. Its clean round geometry creates a lower, more penetrating and predictable trajectory, helping players absorb pace, redirect returns and keep volleys low through fast exchanges. The result is a controlled, connected and highly precise string designed around the unique demands of doubles play.",

    "zh": "Toroline CASH 是 Julian Cash 的签名款圆形共聚酯球线，专门针对现代高水平双打开发。它建立在 A5 平台基础上，但采用更柔和的 Flex 调校，从而增加 Dwell Time、Pocketing 和触球感，同时保留 A5 标志性的高 Snapback、低摩擦和优秀保磅。圆形结构带来更低、更具穿透力并且高度可预测的球路，非常适合双打中吸收来球速度、精准改变回球方向以及在网前快速交换中把球压低。整体定位就是 Connected、Controlled、Surgical——为双打中的接发、截击和快速反应而生。"
  },

